---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import Pricing from "./Pricing.astro";
import { translator, type Locale } from "../lib/i18n";
interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const t = translator(locale);
---

<div class="stack-band wrap">
  <span class="stack-caption">
    {t("Flutter & Dart 専用のCI。", "CI built for Flutter & Dart.")}
  </span>
  <div class="stack-names">
    <span>Flutter</span>
    <span>Dart</span>
    <span>Apple Silicon</span>
    <span>Open source</span>
  </div>
</div>
<section id="features" class="section wrap features">
  <div class="section-label">
    <span class="section-number">01</span>
    <span>WHAT MAKES IT GENUINE</span>
  </div>
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2>
      {t("本物のCIを、", "Real CI.")}
      <br />
      {t("オープンにつくる。", "Built in the open.")}
    </h2>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Genuineは「本物」。Flutter & Dartの開発者にとって、本当に使いたいCIをつくる。そのための、オープンソースプロジェクトです。",
        "Genuine means real. We are building the CI that Flutter & Dart developers want to use, as an open-source project.",
      )}
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-grid">
    <article class="feature">
      <div class="feature-top">
        <span class="feature-icon">
          <Icon name="cpu" marketing />
        </span>
        <span>/ 01</span>
      </div>
      <h3>{t("Flutter & Dartのために。", "Made for Flutter & Dart.")}</h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "GenuineCI自体もDartで書かれています。FlutterアプリもDartパッケージも、いつもの言語でワークフローから支えます。",
          "GenuineCI itself is written in Dart. Use a familiar language to write workflows for your Flutter apps and Dart packages.",
        )}
      </p>
      <div class="feature-tags">
        <span>Built with Dart</span>
        <span>Dart workflows</span>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="feature">
      <div class="feature-top">
        <span class="feature-icon">
          <Icon name="branch" marketing />
        </span>
        <span>/ 02</span>
      </div>
      <h3>{t("Apple Siliconで動かす。", "Run on Apple Silicon.")}</h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "現在の実行マシンはApple Siliconのみ。M1・M2・M3・M4をサポートし、Mac上でビルドとテストを実行します。",
          "Builds and tests currently run on Apple Silicon Macs, with support for M1, M2, M3, and M4.",
        )}
      </p>
      <div class="feature-tags">
        <span>M1 / M2 / M3 / M4</span>
        <span>macOS</span>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="feature">
      <div class="feature-top">
        <span class="feature-icon">
          <Icon name="terminal" marketing />
        </span>
        <span>/ 03</span>
      </div>
      <h3>
        {t("コードも、運用も、自分の手で。", "Your code. Your machines.")}
      </h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "GenuineCIはOSS。ソースコードを読んで、改善に参加することも、自分のApple Siliconマシンでセルフホストすることもできます。",
          "Read the source, contribute improvements, or self-host on your own Apple Silicon machines. GenuineCI is open source.",
        )}
      </p>
      <a
        class="text-link feature-source"
        href="https://github.com/openci-org/openci"
      >
        <span>{t("GitHubでソースを見る", "View source on GitHub")}</span>
        <Icon name="external" marketing />
      </a>
      <div class="feature-tags">
        <span>Open source</span>
        <span>Self-hosted</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="workflow" class="workflow-section">
  <div class="wrap workflow-grid">
    <div class="workflow-copy">
      <div class="section-label">
        <span class="section-number">02</span>
        <span>YOUR WORKFLOW IS DART</span>
      </div>
      <h2>
        {t("ワークフローも、", "Your workflows.")}
        <br />
        {t("いつものDartで。", "The Dart you know.")}
      </h2>
      <p>
        {t(
          "ビルドやテストの手順を、Dartのコードで定義。関数、条件分岐、ループ。アプリ開発で使い慣れた書き方を、そのままCIにも。",
          "Define build and test steps in Dart. Functions, conditionals, and loops: bring the code you already know to your CI.",
        )}
      </p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>
          <Icon name="check" marketing />
          {t("Dartでワークフローを定義する", "Define workflows in Dart")}
        </li>
        <li>
          <Icon name="check" marketing />
          {t("関数にまとめて、手順を再利用する", "Reuse steps with functions")}
        </li>
        <li>
          <Icon name="check" marketing />
          {t(
            "Flutter & Dartの解析・テストを実行する",
            "Analyze and test Flutter & Dart projects",
          )}
        </li>
      </ul>
      <a class="text-link" href="#get-started">
        <span>{t("はじめ方を見る", "See how to get started")}</span>
        <Icon name="arrow" marketing />
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="code-panel">
      <div
        class="code-tabs"
        role="tablist"
        aria-label={t(
          "Dartで定義するワークフローの例",
          "Example workflows written in Dart",
        )}
      >
        <button
          id="tab-flutter"
          class="code-tab active"
          type="button"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="true"
          aria-controls="workflow-flutter"
          tabindex="0"
          data-workflow="flutter"
        >
          Flutter
        </button>
        <button
          id="tab-dart"
          class="code-tab"
          type="button"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          aria-controls="workflow-dart"
          tabindex="-1"
          data-workflow="dart"
        >
          Dart
        </button>
        <span class="code-filetype">DART</span>
      </div>
      <div
        id="workflow-flutter"
        class="code-content dart-content"
        role="tabpanel"
        aria-labelledby="tab-flutter"
        tabindex="0"
      >
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            1
          </span>
          <code>
            <span class="syntax-comment">
              {t(
                "// flutter_ci.dart — 処理部分",
                "// flutter_ci.dart — workflow steps",
              )}
            </span>
          </code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            2
          </span>
          <code>
            <span class="syntax-keyword">await</span> ci.run(
            <span class="syntax-string">'flutter pub get'</span>);
          </code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            3
          </span>
          <code></code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            4
          </span>
          <code>
            <span class="syntax-keyword">await</span>{" "}
            ci.flutter.staticAnalysis();
          </code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            5
          </span>
          <code>
            <span class="syntax-keyword">await</span> ci.flutter.unitTests();
          </code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            6
          </span>
          <code></code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            7
          </span>
          <code>
            <span class="syntax-keyword">await</span> ci.run(
          </code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            8
          </span>
          <code>
            {" "}
            <span class="syntax-string">'flutter build ios --no-codesign'</span>
            ,
          </code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            9
          </span>
          <code>);</code>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        id="workflow-dart"
        class="code-content dart-content"
        role="tabpanel"
        aria-labelledby="tab-dart"
        tabindex="0"
        hidden=""
      >
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            1
          </span>
          <code>
            <span class="syntax-comment">
              {t(
                "// dart_ci.dart — 処理部分",
                "// dart_ci.dart — workflow steps",
              )}
            </span>
          </code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            2
          </span>
          <code>
            <span class="syntax-keyword">for</span> (
            <span class="syntax-keyword">final</span> command{" "}
            <span class="syntax-keyword">in</span> [
          </code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            3
          </span>
          <code>
            {" "}
            <span class="syntax-string">'dart pub get'</span>,
          </code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            4
          </span>
          <code>
            {" "}
            <span class="syntax-string">'dart analyze'</span>,
          </code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            5
          </span>
          <code>
            {" "}
            <span class="syntax-string">'dart test'</span>,
          </code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            6
          </span>
          <code>]) &#123;</code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            7
          </span>
          <code>
            {" "}
            <span class="syntax-keyword">await</span> ci.run(command);
          </code>
        </div>
        <div class="dart-line">
          <span class="line-number" aria-hidden="true">
            8
          </span>
          <code>&#125;</code>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="code-footer">
        <span>
          <Icon name="terminal" marketing />
          {t(
            "Dartワークフロー · 初期化部分は省略",
            "Dart workflow · initialization omitted",
          )}
        </span>
        <span>Apple Silicon</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<Pricing locale={locale} />
<section id="get-started" class="section wrap getting-started">
  <div class="section-label">
    <span class="section-number">04</span>
    <span>YOUR FIRST BUILD STARTS HERE</span>
  </div>
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2>{t("まずは、ひとつのビルドから。", "Start with one build.")}</h2>
    <a class="button button-outline" href="https://dashboard.openci.org/">
      <span>{t("ダッシュボードを開く", "Open dashboard")}</span>
      <Icon name="external" marketing />
    </a>
  </div>
  <ol class="setup-steps">
    <li>
      <span class="setup-number">01</span>
      <h3>{t("プロジェクトを選ぶ", "Choose a project")}</h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "FlutterアプリやDartパッケージ。まずはCIで確かめたいプロジェクトを用意します。",
          "Pick the Flutter app or Dart package you want to check with CI.",
        )}
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="setup-number">02</span>
      <h3>{t("Dartで手順を書く", "Write your steps in Dart")}</h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "静的解析、テスト、ビルド。必要な処理をDartのワークフローとして定義します。",
          "Analysis, tests, and builds. Define the steps you need as a Dart workflow.",
        )}
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="setup-number">03</span>
      <h3>{t("Apple Siliconで実行", "Run on Apple Silicon")}</h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "M1〜M4のMacでワークフローを実行。自分のマシンでセルフホストすることもできます。",
          "Run your workflow on an M1–M4 Mac. You can also self-host on your own machines.",
        )}
      </p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
<section class="faq-section wrap">
  <div>
    <div class="section-label">
      <span class="section-number">05</span>
      <span>GOOD TO KNOW</span>
    </div>
    <h2>{t("よくある質問", "Frequently asked questions")}</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <details>
      <summary>
        {t(
          "GenuineCIという名前には、どんな意味がありますか？",
          "What does GenuineCI mean?",
        )}
        <span class="faq-plus" aria-hidden="true">
          +
        </span>
      </summary>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Genuineは「本物」という意味です。Flutter & Dartの開発者にとって、本当に使いたい、本物のCIをつくることを目指しています。",
          "Genuine means real. Our goal is to build real CI that Flutter & Dart developers want to use.",
        )}
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>
        {t(
          "どんなプロジェクトに対応していますか？",
          "What projects does it support?",
        )}
        <span class="faq-plus" aria-hidden="true">
          +
        </span>
      </summary>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Flutter & Dart専用です。FlutterアプリやDartパッケージの静的解析、テスト、ビルドなどを、Dartで定義したワークフローで実行します。",
          "GenuineCI is built for Flutter & Dart. Run analysis, tests, builds, and more for Flutter apps and Dart packages using workflows written in Dart.",
        )}
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>
        {t("どのマシンで動きますか？", "What machines does it run on?")}
        <span class="faq-plus" aria-hidden="true">
          +
        </span>
      </summary>
      <p>
        {t(
          "現在はApple Silicon搭載のMacのみが対象です。M1・M2・M3・M4に対応しています。",
          "Currently, Apple Silicon Macs are supported: M1, M2, M3, and M4.",
        )}
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>
        {t("セルフホストできますか？", "Can I self-host?")}
        <span class="faq-plus" aria-hidden="true">
          +
        </span>
      </summary>
      <p>
        {t(
          "はい。GenuineCIはオープンソースです。自分のApple Siliconマシンを使ってセルフホストすることもできます。",
          "Yes. GenuineCI is open source, and you can self-host on your own Apple Silicon machines.",
        )}
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>
        {t(
          "GenuineCI自体は何で書かれていますか？",
          "What is GenuineCI built with?",
        )}
        <span class="faq-plus" aria-hidden="true">
          +
        </span>
      </summary>
      <p>
        {t(
          "GenuineCIはDartで書かれています。サービス自体の実装も、利用するワークフローの定義もDartです。",
          "GenuineCI is written in Dart. Both the service and your workflow definitions use Dart.",
        )}
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>
        {t("ワークフローは何で書きますか？", "How do I write a workflow?")}
        <span class="faq-plus" aria-hidden="true">
          +
        </span>
      </summary>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Dartで定義します。関数や条件分岐、ループなど、Dartの言語機能を使ってビルドやテストの手順を組み立てられます。",
          "Write it in Dart. Use functions, conditionals, loops, and other Dart language features to put together your build and test steps.",
        )}
      </p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="closing">
  <div class="wrap closing-content">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">GENUINE MEANS REAL.</p>
      <h2>
        {t("本物のCIを、", "Real CI.")}
        <br />
        {t("一緒につくろう。", "Built together.")}
      </h2>
    </div>
    <a class="button button-dark" href="#get-started">
      <span>{t("GenuineCI をはじめる", "Get started with GenuineCI")}</span>
      <Icon name="arrow" marketing />
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap footer-wordmark" aria-hidden="true">
    GenuineCI
  </div>
</section>
